{"3459520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You are the Bomb: A Game About Rolling Bombs", "steam_appid": 3459520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling adventure in <strong>You Are The Bomb: A Game About Rolling Bombs</strong>, a 3D platformer set in the enchanting yet perilous land of Boomerland.  With an explosive gameplay, vibrant environments, and challenging mechanics, this game will keep you rolling with excitement!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/ee217e189330403e2924cec11a3285a1.avif?t=1772278216\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras_big/ee217e189330403e2924cec11a3285a1.avif?t=1772278216 width=800 height=450 /></span>From dodging enemy bombs to navigating molten lava lakes, every moment in <strong>You Are The Bomb: A Game About Rolling Bombs</strong> is packed with challenges that will test your wits and reflexes. Whether you’re planning your level escape or perfecting your skills in time-based challenges, there’s always a reason to jump back in and play again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ <strong>Time-Based Levels + Boss Fights</strong><br>Dive into a variety of detailed levels, full of secrets to unveil and coins to collect, each more thrilling and challenging than the last, with some epic boss battles that will test your mettle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/c14de832a16ac786ee12a64f010cc58f.poster.avif?t=1772278216\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/c14de832a16ac786ee12a64f010cc58f.webm?t=1772278216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/c14de832a16ac786ee12a64f010cc58f.mp4?t=1772278216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ <strong>Race Against Time</strong><br>In each level, the clock is ticking since the fuse has been lit. Can you find your way to the magical well before it’s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/3c665f7a16308ae3f1c117d2203d640b.poster.avif?t=1772278216\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/3c665f7a16308ae3f1c117d2203d640b.webm?t=1772278216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/3c665f7a16308ae3f1c117d2203d640b.mp4?t=1772278216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Temple (Time Challenge Mode)</strong><br>Prove your worth in the Temple of boomers! Race to complete the boomerland Temple in record time, to secure your place as the ultimate Boomer Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/9d6cefb4c79272af23cee1dc0fda93c9.poster.avif?t=1772278216\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/9d6cefb4c79272af23cee1dc0fda93c9.webm?t=1772278216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 <strong>Replayable Levels</strong><br>Level Select Mode lets you revisit any level you’ve unlocked. Replay your favorites, beat your previous records, or unveil some hidden surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/b806c8a8edf39be31489c6d6c02c1982.poster.avif?t=1772278216\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/b806c8a8edf39be31489c6d6c02c1982.webm?t=1772278216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/b806c8a8edf39be31489c6d6c02c1982.mp4?t=1772278216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 <strong>Hidden Gems</strong> <br>Explore each level to discover hidden gems! Collecting these treasures unlocks new playable Boomers, each with unique attributes. Can you find them all and unleash the full army of Boomers?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/466c89b2ff8eaee0c97a2198d0294552.poster.avif?t=1772278216\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/466c89b2ff8eaee0c97a2198d0294552.webm?t=1772278216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 <strong>Dynamic Enemies &amp; Environmental</strong> <strong>Traps</strong> <br>Prepare to face cunning foes and devious traps that challenge both your reflexes and strategy. Stay focus, dodge danger, and remember: one wrong move could lead to an explosive end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/17c006b1ecce145ff6bcb2562e461847.poster.avif?t=1772278216\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/17c006b1ecce145ff6bcb2562e461847.webm?t=1772278216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☀️ <strong>Stylized Cel-Shading Visuals</strong> <br>Enjoy stunning sunsets, detailed environments, and mesmerizing visual effects that bring Boomerland to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/b7633f3db3b163313031d68425000cef.poster.avif?t=1772278216\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/b7633f3db3b163313031d68425000cef.webm?t=1772278216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Achievements</strong><br>Unlock Steam Achievements as you progress through the game, showcasing your skills and dedication to become a <strong>Grand Master Boomer!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You’ll Love Rolling Bombs:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a fan of classic 3D platformers or looking for a fresh, modern take on the genre, <strong>You Are The Bomb: A Game About Rolling Bombs</strong> offers something for everyone. The game focuses on you learning the rolling mechanics to improve <strong>your skills </strong>rather than relying on “leveling up” or “ability points”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect mix of fast-paced action, strategic gameplay, and a dash of humor makes this an unforgettable experience. From tackling boss fights to discovering secrets and new locations, every roll will be a new adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from The Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made entirely by one person, me (Hi, I'm Rob!). I spent the last 2 years working on this project. Personally, I'm a fan of games that feels initially really difficult but then become almost easy once you really get the hang of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is following this spirit I designed <strong>You Are The Bomb: A Game About Rolling Bombs</strong>. If you decide to purchase a copy, I  thank you for supporting this project and I hope that you'll enjoy this challenging game. Remember ... should you find yourself frustrated, never give up! The clock is ticking, and the world is waiting for its hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let’s roll into this journey together! 💣</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling adventure in <strong>You Are The Bomb: A Game About Rolling Bombs</strong>, a 3D platformer set in the enchanting yet perilous land of Boomerland.  With an explosive gameplay, vibrant environments, and challenging mechanics, this game will keep you rolling with excitement!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras/ee217e189330403e2924cec11a3285a1.avif?t=1772278216\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/extras_big/ee217e189330403e2924cec11a3285a1.avif?t=1772278216 width=800 height=450 /></span>From dodging enemy bombs to navigating molten lava lakes, every moment in <strong>You Are The Bomb: A Game About Rolling Bombs</strong> is packed with challenges that will test your wits and reflexes. Whether you’re planning your level escape or perfecting your skills in time-based challenges, there’s always a reason to jump back in and play again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ <strong>Time-Based Levels + Boss Fights</strong><br>Dive into a variety of detailed levels, full of secrets to unveil and coins to collect, each more thrilling and challenging than the last, with some epic boss battles that will test your mettle.</p><p class=