”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect mix of fast-paced action, strategic gameplay, and a dash of humor makes this an unforgettable experience. From tackling boss fights to discovering secrets and new locations, every roll will be a new adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from The Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made entirely by one person, me (Hi, I'm Rob!). I spent the last 2 years working on this project. Personally, I'm a fan of games that feels initially really difficult but then become almost easy once you really get the hang of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is following this spirit I designed <strong>You Are The Bomb: A Game About Rolling Bombs</strong>. If you decide to purchase a copy, I  thank you for supporting this project and I hope that you'll enjoy this challenging game. Remember ... should you find yourself frustrated, never give up! The clock is ticking, and the world is waiting for its hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let’s roll into this journey together! 💣</p>", "short_description": "Collect coins, gems and gun powder, uncover secrets, and conquer epic bosses across time-based levels. Test your skills by mastering the rolling mechanics in this action-packed 3D platformer! Face dynamic environments, harness powerful abilities, and race to save the magical world of Boomerland!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/2d3b845c018783630e5ab5acf17de963238eba40/header.jpg?t=1772278216", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/7683fec03d140ccb16594558b78ac0901cd3dd33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772278216", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459520/7683fec03d140ccb16594558b78ac0901cd3dd33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772278216", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requ